  <div id="panel-sounds" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-sounds" class="panel" hidden>
    <p class="lede">Made with ElevenLabs on Sat 14 Nov from our own text prompts: an example for Kirill, and the final sound if his files do not come. They are in the game now, under the file names of his brief, so his WAVs replace them with no code change.</p>

    <section aria-labelledby="music">
      <div class="sechead"><h2 id="music">Music: 120 BPM, one 8-bar loop</h2><p>Four layers in step. Each cut of the Publisher drops one, lead first, drums last.</p></div>
      <div class="tracks">
        <div class="track wide"><div class="tag">All four layers <span class="code">full game</span></div><p>What plays before the first cut.</p><audio controls loop preload="none" src="audio/mus_main_all_stems.mp3"></audio></div>
        <div class="track"><div class="tag">Drums <span class="code">mus_main_1_drums</span></div><p>Goes last.</p><audio controls loop preload="none" src="audio/mus_main_1_drums.mp3"></audio></div>
        <div class="track"><div class="tag">Bass <span class="code">mus_main_2_bass</span></div><p>Pulsing sixteenths.</p><audio controls loop preload="none" src="audio/mus_main_2_bass.mp3"></audio></div>
        <div class="track"><div class="tag">Pad <span class="code">mus_main_3_pad</span></div><p>Split from the synth stem: everything but the centred highs.</p><audio controls loop preload="none" src="audio/mus_main_3_pad.mp3"></audio></div>
        <div class="track"><div class="tag">Lead <span class="code">mus_main_4_lead</span></div><p>Split from the synth stem: the centred highs. Goes first.</p><audio controls loop preload="none" src="audio/mus_main_4_lead.mp3"></audio></div>
        <div class="track"><div class="tag">Proof of concept <span class="code">mus_poc_loop</span></div><p>Everything is cut: a bare click and a thin bass.</p><audio controls loop preload="none" src="audio/mus_poc_loop.mp3"></audio></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="sfx">
      <div class="sechead"><h2 id="sfx">Sound effects</h2><p>14 one-shots, levelled by role: frequent hits quiet, rare big moments loud.</p></div>
      <div class="tracks">
        <div class="track"><div class="tag">Katana slash <span class="code">sfx_katana_slash_01</span></div><p>Every swing, hero or Publisher.</p><audio controls preload="none" src="audio/sfx_katana_slash_01.mp3"></audio></div>
        <div class="track"><div class="tag">Shuriken throw <span class="code">sfx_shuriken_throw_01</span></div><p>A shuriken leaves a hand.</p><audio controls preload="none" src="audio/sfx_shuriken_throw_01.mp3"></audio></div>
        <div class="track"><div class="tag">Explosion <span class="code">sfx_explosion_01</span></div><p>Every third shuriken blows up.</p><audio controls preload="none" src="audio/sfx_explosion_01.mp3"></audio></div>
        <div class="track"><div class="tag">Slam <span class="code">sfx_slam_01</span></div><p>The heavy Publisher's two-fist ground slam.</p><audio controls preload="none" src="audio/sfx_slam_01.mp3"></audio></div>
        <div class="track"><div class="tag">Dash <span class="code">sfx_dash_01</span></div><p>Space.</p><audio controls preload="none" src="audio/sfx_dash_01.mp3"></audio></div>
        <div class="track"><div class="tag">Parry <span class="code">sfx_parry_01</span></div><p>A shot sent back, only on a real deflect.</p><audio controls preload="none" src="audio/sfx_parry_01.mp3"></audio></div>
        <div class="track"><div class="tag">Ultimate <span class="code">sfx_ultimate_01</span></div><p>The slash across the arena.</p><audio controls preload="none" src="audio/sfx_ultimate_01.mp3"></audio></div>
        <div class="track"><div class="tag">Ultimate ready <span class="code">sfx_ultimate_ready_01</span></div><p>The hero's meter fills.</p><audio controls preload="none" src="audio/sfx_ultimate_ready_01.mp3"></audio></div>
        <div class="track"><div class="tag">Boss hit <span class="code">sfx_boss_hit_01</span></div><p>Any blow on the Publisher.</p><audio controls preload="none" src="audio/sfx_boss_hit_01.mp3"></audio></div>
        <div class="track"><div class="tag">Hero hurt <span class="code">sfx_hero_hurt_01</span></div><p>The ronin takes a hit.</p><audio controls preload="none" src="audio/sfx_hero_hurt_01.mp3"></audio></div>
        <div class="track"><div class="tag">Steal card <span class="code">sfx_steal_card_01</span></div><p>"The Publisher has notes" pops up.</p><audio controls preload="none" src="audio/sfx_steal_card_01.mp3"></audio></div>
        <div class="track"><div class="tag">Steal <span class="code">sfx_steal_01</span></div><p>A move is torn out of the game.</p><audio controls preload="none" src="audio/sfx_steal_01.mp3"></audio></div>
        <div class="track"><div class="tag">Everything back <span class="code">sfx_everything_back_01</span></div><p>The Publisher is stunned, all moves return.</p><audio controls preload="none" src="audio/sfx_everything_back_01.mp3"></audio></div>
        <div class="track"><div class="tag">Final blow <span class="code">sfx_final_blow_01</span></div><p>The Ultimate that wins the fight.</p><audio controls preload="none" src="audio/sfx_final_blow_01.mp3"></audio></div>
